      ],
      "reference_temperature_k": 298.15,
      "lattice_a_uncertainty_a": 5e-05,
      "oxygen_u_uncertainty": 0.0001,
      "notes": "Table 1 Si-standard-present refinement including (111): a=8.44192(5) A, u=0.2594(1). Standard Fd-3m origin-2 inverse-spinel Wyckoff model: Mg tetrahedral 8a; Mg/Ti 1:1 on octahedral 16d; O 32e. Inversion x=1.000(3) supports the ideal fully inverse occupancies. Z=8 derived from 8+16 cations and 32 O per conventional cell. This separately measured same-composition structure is a diffraction fallback, not a refinement of the Lv sample. Its lattice differs legitimately from Lv Table 1 and each fitted V0."
    },
